WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.840
(sizzling)

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.340
- [Chef Deborah] Someone once told me

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.923
that I had three strikes against me.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.973
I'm African-American, I'm
female, and I'm a lesbian.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:17.150
In this culinary world,
we are a group of people

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.700
that are underrepresented,

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:25.070
and I chose to not let those
three strikes be my out.

00:00:29.709 --> 00:00:33.440
(classical piano etude)

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:37.357
- [Announcer] BMW proudly
supports the LGBTQ community.

00:00:39.945 --> 00:00:42.612
(jazz drumming)

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.030
- Twisted Soul Cookhouse is my baby.

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:51.173
It is a dream come true.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.700
So what makes Twisted Soul different

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:59.260
from the other restaurants
in Atlanta is me.

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:00.683
This is my story.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.330
So before I started
cooking professionally,

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.214
I was a flight attendant for 33 years

00:01:07.214 --> 00:01:09.610
and I found myself on layovers.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.400
My favorite tourist activity
was grocery shopping.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.370
I loved working in first class

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:17.790
and then just adding my own little nuances

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:19.973
and touches to the first class meal.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:24.130
At a point, I decided I
had to be true to myself

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:29.650
and just open a restaurant
and start cooking every day

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:31.450
doing something that I wanted to do.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:39.330
I run Twisted Soul with my
wife and also my daughter.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:42.723
We are that family that works
together and plays together.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:47.960
When I first decided I
was interested in women,

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:50.800
I was very quiet about it.

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:54.740
I was afraid of how it
would affect my business.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:56.930
And then I realized one day

00:01:56.930 --> 00:02:00.803
that I was doing myself an injustice.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:06.690
Once I became comfortable
with who I was and my talent,

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:08.003
I became unstoppable.

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.900
What I do is global comfort food,

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.140
and for me, that is soul food.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:18.360
I think all cultures have a soul.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:21.810
I felt like soul food was a
food that was underrepresented

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:25.120
and was presented as being
unhealthy, not pretty,

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.670
and I decided I wanted
to do something about it

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:31.090
by infusing it with other cultures.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:33.820
I have a little bit of Jamaican influence;

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:38.020
there's Asian influence;
there's African influence.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.930
I am telling the story of my life.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:43.100
When people come to the restaurant,

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.970
I want them to experience what
it's like to be in my home.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:49.840
I love to see their faces

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:52.470
and watch them close their eyes

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:56.100
and just salivate over what I've created.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:57.880
Since Twisted Soul has opened,

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:00.890
we've been featured on major networks,

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:05.180
we've been featured in
multiple publications,

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.190
we get guests from all over the world,

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:11.793
and we're looking at opening
restaurant number two.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:18.670
The soul of food for me
is what comes from within.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:23.670
Being African-American,
being a female, being lesbian

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.550
in a white, male-dominated industry

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:29.533
has not stopped me from being myself.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.470
Passion does not have gender,

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.520
passion does not have a color,

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.943
and my passion has taken me far.

00:03:44.798 --> 00:03:46.965
(chiming)

